  "title": "USAG Humphreys Emergency Services Test Readiness During Simulated Airfield Mishap",
  "description": "Emergency responders from U.S. Army Garrison Humphreys, South Korea, transport a simulated casualty during a major accident response exercise at Desiderio Army Airfield, Aug. 24, 2026. The training evaluated firefighters, medical personnel and emergency response teams during a simulated Beechcraft C-12 Huron forced landing involving seven mock casualties to enhance overall response capabilities and interagency coordination. (U.S Army video by Cpl. Kim Tae Sung)",
